anchor     basedefs/sys_socket.h.html#DESCRIPTION/sockaddr
class      required
says       <sys/socket.h> defines struct sockaddr as a complete type
           with at least the members sa_family (sa_family_t), sa_data
           (char[]).
test       t/017-struct-sockaddr.c
nomutant   compile-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants

